IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ARITH.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(4) VALUE 100.
01 WS-B PIC 9(4) VALUE 25.
01 WS-SUM PIC 9(5).
01 WS-PROD PIC 9(6).
01 WS-QUOT PIC 9(3)V99.
01 WS-PCT PIC 9(2)V99.
01 WS-BIG PIC 9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ADD WS-A WS-B GIVING WS-SUM.
    DISPLAY WS-SUM.
    SUBTRACT WS-B FROM WS-A.
    DISPLAY WS-A.
    MOVE 100 TO WS-A.
    MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-PROD.
    DISPLAY WS-PROD.
    DIVIDE WS-A BY 4 GIVING WS-QUOT.
    DISPLAY WS-QUOT.
    COMPUTE WS-PCT ROUNDED = WS-B / 3.
    DISPLAY WS-PCT.
    COMPUTE WS-BIG = 1234.
    DISPLAY WS-BIG.
    ADD 999 999 GIVING WS-BIG ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "SIZE ERROR".
    DISPLAY WS-BIG.
    STOP RUN.
